-*   $N_p$: Number of rays per group. Typical values used in evaluation are $N_p=4$ and $N_p=8$ [S1].
-*   $R^1, R^2$: Reduction factors. For MIMO-NeRF-self-R2, $R^1=1$ and $R^2=1$ [S1].
